{"unit_id":"lwklbb__dsh-worktrees#card-zh","repo":"lwklbb/dsh-worktrees","commit":"7da00c22e8f7ae5480b0b1acca750cb44f090638","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-worktrees 是面向 DSH Web 的 Git worktree 管理插件，在设置面板加入 Worktrees 页面，并从 DSH 工作区扫描 Git 仓库。用户可以查看仓库分支和 worktree 的路径、分支、分离状态、改动及同步状态，按新分支、已有引用或 detached 模式创建 worktree，随后将目录加入工作区或直接打开；也可以移除非主 worktree、清理失效记录。适合需要在多个分支上并行处理同一项目的 DSH 用户。运行需要本机 Git 命令可用，并依赖 DSH Web 的工作区、设置界面与服务接口。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:309-325","lib/index.js:78-128","lib/git.js:181-195","lib/git.js:197-245"]}
{"unit_id":"lwklbb__dsh-worktrees#card-en","repo":"lwklbb/dsh-worktrees","commit":"7da00c22e8f7ae5480b0b1acca750cb44f090638","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-worktrees adds a Worktrees page to DSH Web Settings. It scans workspace repositories and shows branches, paths, and status. Create worktrees from a new branch, existing ref, or detached commit; add/open them in DSH; remove non-main worktrees; prune stale records. Git must be available locally.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:309-325","lib/index.js:78-128","lib/git.js:181-195","lib/git.js:197-245"]}
